    hasChoice: 0
    choiceAText: 
    choiceBText: 
    choiceCText: 
    repDeltaA: 0
    repDeltaB: 0
    repDeltaC: 0
    nextIfA: 0
    nextIfB: 0
    nextIfC: 
    goTo: Dialogue 3
  - nodeName: Dialogue 3
    text: I hope you would share the same mindset.
    hasChoice: 1
    choiceAText: I think your people have treated us like dirt.
    choiceBText: " I don\u2019t want to share my opinion with you if that\u2019s
      alright."
    choiceCText: Yes I know this war is affecting both sides greatly...
    repDeltaA: -1
    repDeltaB: 0
    repDeltaC: 1
    nextIfA: Option A
    nextIfB: Option B
    nextIfC: Option C
    goTo: Dialogue 4
  - nodeName: Option A
    text: Ah well then, you'd be much better of without my patronage.
